1 0 0 1 57.02362 572.8661 cm
q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The temporary decrease was treated as an important verification result rather than as a reason to apply changes) Tj T* (blindly. Lynis recalculates its index from the tests and system state detected at each audit; therefore, a) Tj T* (configuration change does not automatically translate into a higher score. The captured evidence does not isolate) Tj T* (one single cause for the 65) Tj /F4 9.5 Tf 14 TL (\256) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL (62 change, so the report deliberately avoids claiming an unsupported cause.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
