0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 60.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL -0.061332 Tw (The project concentrated on practical hardening measures that were appropriate to the observed Kali environment.) Tj T* 0 Tw (Documented actions included tightening the default UMASK, investigating and removing the ATFTP server,) Tj T* (installing several security and maintenance utilities, enabling and verifying Fail2Ban, and strengthening the local) Tj T* (login warning banners. The remaining Lynis recommendations were reviewed but not all were implemented) Tj T* (because several are system-purpose dependent or could unnecessarily disrupt a security-testing workstation.) Tj T* ET
Q
Q
q
1 0 0 1 57.02362 448.8661 cm
q
BT 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm 14 TL /F1 9.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (The final result therefore reflects a ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (risk-based hardening approach) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf ( rather than an attempt to maximize the Lynis) Tj T* (number at any cost. The system reached a higher score while preserving the functionality required from a Kali) Tj T* (Linux training and security-testing environment.) Tj T* ET
