BT 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The project successfully demonstrated a repeatable Linux hardening workflow using Lynis. The most important) Tj T* (achievement is not simply the final number, but the documented relationship between findings, remediation,) Tj T* (verification and re-audit.) Tj T* ET
