BT 1 0 0 1 0 32.5 Tm 14 TL /F1 9.5 Tf 0 0 0 rg (Starting from a hardening index of ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (65) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (, the project encountered an intermediate reduction to ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (62) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (, recovered to ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (63) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (,) Tj T* (and ultimately reached ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (68) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (. The final result is therefore ) Tj /F2 9.5 Tf (3 points higher than the original baseline) Tj /F1 9.5 Tf (. The) Tj T* (progression also demonstrates why security configuration should be validated after every significant change.) Tj T* ET
