BT 1 0 0 1 0 46.5 Tm /F1 9.5 Tf 14 TL (The remediation work addressed several concrete defensive controls: safer default permissions through UMASK) Tj T* (027, removal of an unnecessary TFTP server component, installation of security/maintenance utilities, active) Tj T* -0.106243 Tw (Fail2Ban protection for SSH authentication abuse, package-file integrity checking with debsums, and stronger login) Tj T* 0 Tw (warning banners.) Tj T* ET
